Third-party code
----------------
app/src/main/java/de/emil/shizubox/installer/ is ported from Universal Installer
(https://github.com/pass-with-high-score/universal-installer),
Copyright (C) pass-with-high-score and contributors, GPL-3.0.

app/src/main/java/de/emil/shizubox/updates/ follows the design of Obtainium
(https://github.com/ImranR98/Obtainium) and ObtainX (https://github.com/bikram-agarwal/ObtainX),
both GPL-3.0; the app list export is compatible with their JSON format.

app/src/main/assets/debloat_uad.json is an excerpt (Google/AOSP lists and packages found on Pixel phones) of
uad_lists.json from Universal Android Debloater Next Generation
(https://github.com/Universal-Debloater-Alliance/universal-android-debloater-next-generation, commit 76992ec),
Copyright (C) the Universal Debloater Alliance and contributors, GPL-3.0. Ratings are adjusted for Pixels in apps/Debloat.kt.

Libraries: Shizuku API (Apache-2.0), Ackpine (Apache-2.0), Haze (Apache-2.0), AndroidX incl. WorkManager (Apache-2.0),
MaterialKolor (MIT).

Video downloader (all GPL-3.0 compatible):
- youtubedl-android (https://github.com/JunkFood02/youtubedl-android), GPL-3.0
- yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp), The Unlicense
- FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), built by youtubedl-android, GPL/LGPL
- Python (bundled by youtubedl-android), PSF License
- NewPipe Extractor (https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipeExtractor), GPL-3.0
- Mozilla Rhino (MPL-2.0, GPL-compatible via its secondary-license clause), jsoup (MIT),
  nanojson (Apache-2.0), protobuf-javalite (BSD-3-Clause), Jackson (Apache-2.0),
  Apache Commons Compress/IO (Apache-2.0)

HiLight (Pixel 11 Pro LED bar): app/src/main/java/de/emil/shizubox/hilight/ ports the light-session
access, the black-clear sequence, the pattern maths, the safety limits and the privacy timing of
HiLight Studio (https://github.com/DhananjayBhosale/hilight-studio, commit 63a68f3), MIT License:

